## Header Patterns

### Content-Type Headers

| Connector | Content-Type |
|-----------|--------------|
| Airwallex | `application/json` |
| Getnet | `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` |
| Paypal | `application/x-www-form-urlencoded` |
